      <activity id="57718c71-66ad-509a-8213-7bedd7633021" activityNameId="2e5c1533-a8cf-560c-b3ea-7d1e0464906d" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Disposal, facilities, chemical production</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Disposal, facilities, chemical production
na;
UUID: e181eeac-9e2b-476f-a1ce-2432386c0999
This module includes the processes used for dismantling and disposal of the production facilities for chemicals per kg of the facilities. The included processes are: transport of metals from dismantling site to recycling / landfilling. Not included is the transport and the further treatment of concrete and rock woll (separate modules).; Geography: Data used has no specific geographical origin (assumptions).
Location: Data used has no specific geographical origin (assumptions).
Technology: estimated dismantling of the facilities of a chemical plant, assuming that only 50% of the metals can be recyled and the rest has - due to contamination reason  - be landfilled.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_e181eeac-9e2b-476f-a1ce-2432386c0999.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
